 <span begin="1:37.331" end="1:37.936">un</span> <span begin="1:37.936" end="1:39.146">colț</span> <span begin="1:39.146" end="1:39.751">de</span> <span begin="1:39.751" end="1:41.566">cer,</span></p><p begin="1:41.566" end="1:48.219" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:41.566" end="1:42.170">Cu</span> <span begin="1:42.170" end="1:43.380">viață</span> <span begin="1:43.380" end="1:45.195">pentru</span> <span begin="1:45.195" end="1:46.405">cei</span> <span begin="1:46.405" end="1:47.010">ce</span> <span begin="1:47.010" end="1:48.219">pier,</span></p><p begin="1:48.219" end="1:55.478" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:48.219" end="1:48.824">Să</span> <span begin="1:48.824" end="1:50.639">guste</span> <span begin="1:50.639" end="1:54.268">orișicine</span> <span begin="1:54.268" end="1:55.478">vrea</span></p><p begin="1:55.478" end="2:02.737" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:55.478" end="1:57.898">Iubirea</span> <span begin="1:57.898" end="1:59.108">și</span> <span begin="1:59.108" end="2:01.527">dreptatea</span> <span begin="2:01.527" end="2:02.737">Ta!</span></p></div></body></tt>